---
/**
 * /widebeam phone bar (lane A, A.3; guidelines-05, mobile-03): at <= 900 px a strip at the bottom edge carries the one
 * ask, askFor().sticky, once the plate has scrolled away. DriftStickyBar's mechanics (src/components/drift/
 * DriftStickyBar.astro): fixed bottom, safe-area padding, starts away, away while any [data-wb-cta] (the hero column,
 * the plate's form, the closer's form), the manual frame ([data-wb-manual]) or the footer is on screen, away while an
 * email field has focus and after a sign-up, hidden while the cookie banner is up; the cart FAB and the SOUND key ride
 * above it. The script is furniture.ts; the bottom edge's one owner is its --wb-lift stack.
 * The key takes the visitor to the plate's form (no form of its own: one form per ask, one source).
 */
import { askFor } from '../../data/widebeam';

const ask = askFor();
---
<div class="wb-bar is-away" data-wb-bar>
  <a class="rv-btn rv-btn--sm wb-bar-key" href="#wb-get" data-wb-bar-key>{ask.sticky.replace(/ ▸$/, '')} <span aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span></a>
  <span class="wb-bar-micro">{ask.label}</span>
</div>
